<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-18T01:17:04.847Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:17:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has formally allied with the M23 rebels, expanding an anti-government coalition that is now attacking the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, killing a former New Zealand special forces officer and wounding former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. Regional talks involving Rwanda, DR Congo and Burundi are slated for Zambia to address the armed groups. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPM054WjJ0dE5aT1ByU0NFWmphM0oycE5hdHpiZW9vU3pTb0lxUXNQY0VFb2tBT1JOUVRDaThhLTVZR0VFa0ZjSFpvalprRWRRNUdaRTVSVFg0SDZQWWoyWi1oaHg2eS1KaVZmM3gzb0pMc3prSXBnWEV1Wk9BbEZ3R3ptV1dTMHh2aVBmaGN0RkpDdE9xMEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPcjUybHpxMUdtSGRWaWJkTlFPMFJzM3pJR29JS1AwU1VBUnE3bjNWZjlJajdSMVR4VWJoVVpDU3ZMOExWX2JMY09UX2xPb1dPbzM2R0FVZV9YWk5iMlFGM1p2UmRlR01ZYjZpMnlhSnpoby14VWIxOXM2eWdrNVkxa3BSRnktSzZyUzhEYWZRNUdIUFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;globalpost.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQZnctYUFzakhUWWZxU203N2otbUZzTHJ0X3JEUVNldmRMNGF1VFNJTjZFWEVsUUl4bHRrYTgya3lMREVyVWdXZDZfc3N4b2RBaGRQdHdTRlBmYzdhNGV5TGJZZm1jTmpWZU85U3NFQ0xWd1hjVzN1c2RZYTBMbHludGpqQ0l1Y3l3Z3JVYXBNU0VwRXVndTFYMWFTQUQ3WUdHcVBXY28yc0lwY0VDU1pz?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl